 "一〇月": "أَكْتُوبَر, تِشْرِين الْأَوَّل (The tenth month of the Gregorian calendar, following September and preceding Nov)  [October]\nمثال: 私は１９７２年１０月１０日に生まれました。\n→ I was born on October 10, 1972. / [tenth month of the lunar calendar]",
