 "一たび": "مَرَّةً, مَرَّةً وَاحِدَةً (One and only one time.) / بِمُجَرَّد أَنّ (As soon as; when; after.)  [once]\nمثال: 習慣は一度身についてしまうと、断ち切るのがとても難しい。\n→ A habit is very difficult to shake off once it is formed. / مُؤَقَّتًا (For a limited period of time; not permanently.)  [temporarily] / [one degree ; one tone]\nمثال: 赤道における経度1度当たりの長さ。\n→ Distance per degree of longitude at equator.",
