 "一九": "تِسْعَةَ عَشَرَ (The cardinal number occurring after eighteen and before twenty, represented in R)  [nineteen]",
 "一九日": "[19th day of the month] / [19 days] / مُغَفَّل, أَحْمَق (A person with poor judgment or little intelligence.)  [fool]",
 "一二": "اِثْنَا عَشَرَ (The cardinal number occurring after eleven and before thirteen, represented in A)  [twelve] / مَلِكَة, مَلِكَة (A female monarch.) / وَزِير, فرزان (Referring to one of several items used in tabletop games:) / تفرزن (To promote a pawn to a queen.)  [queen]",
 "一二に及ばず": "فَوْرًا, حَالًا (Very soon; quickly; immediately.)  [right away]",
 "一二月": "دِيسِمْبِر, دِيسَمْبِر (The twelfth and last month of the Gregorian calendar, following November and pre)  [December]\nمثال: 再来月は１２月だ。\n→ The month after next is December. / [twelfth month of the lunar calendar]",
 "一五": "خَمْسَةَ عَشَرَ (The cardinal number occurring after fourteen (14) and before sixteen (16).)  [fifteen]\nمثال: １１時１５分前を少し過ぎています。\n→ It is a little after a quarter to eleven.",
 "一人": "[one person]\nesp. 一人, １人\nمثال: 私は一人の弟がいます。\n→ I have one brother. / [being alone ; being by oneself]\nمثال: ジムは目覚めると、自分が部屋に１人なのに気がついた。\n→ Jim awoke and found himself alone in the room. / [being single ; being unmarried]\nesp. 独り / لوحد (without help) / لحال (without help)  [by oneself]\nمثال: 彼はひとりになると即座にその手紙を開いた。\n→ The moment that he was alone he opened the letter.",
 "一人ごちる": "غَمْغَمَة, تَمْتَمة (A repressed or obscure utterance; an instance of muttering.) / تَمْتَمَ, هَمْهَمَ (To utter words, especially complaints or angry expressions, indistinctly or with) / تَمْتَمَ, هَمْهَمَ (To speak softly and incoherently, or with imperfect articulations.)  [to mutter]",
 "一人ごつ": "غَمْغَمَة, تَمْتَمة (A repressed or obscure utterance; an instance of muttering.) / تَمْتَمَ, هَمْهَمَ (To utter words, especially complaints or angry expressions, indistinctly or with) / تَمْتَمَ, هَمْهَمَ (To speak softly and incoherently, or with imperfect articulations.)  [to mutter]",
