 "一人ぽっち": "اِنْفِرَاد (condition of being lonely) / عُزْلَة (condition of being lonely) / وَحْدَة (condition of being lonely)  [loneliness]\nمثال: 一人ぼっちで暮らしたくはない。\n→ I don't want to live by myself.",
