 "一人前": "[one portion ; one serving]\nمثال: 彼は焼き魚定食一人前を注文した。\n→ He ordered one grilled fish dinner. / بَالِغ, رَاشِد (An animal that is full-grown.)  [adult]\nمثال: 彼女も一人前の女になった。\n→ She has grown up to be a woman. / مُتَرَسِّخ (Having been in existence for a long time and therefore recognized and generally )  [established]",
