 "一人占め": "اِحْتَكَرَ (To have a monopoly on something.)  [monopolizing]\nمثال: 彼はこの広い部屋を独り占めしている。\n→ He has this large room to himself.",
 "一人残らず": "كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [(one and) all]\nمثال: クラブ会員は１人残らずみな出席していた。\n→ Each and every member of the club was present.",
