 "一人部屋": "غُرْفَة لِشَخْص وَاحِد (A room that has one single bed.)  [single room]\nمثال: 浴室付きの一人部屋ですね。\n→ Single with bath, right?",
 "一仕事": "هَدَف, مَقْصَد (A piece of work done as part of one’s duties.)  [task]\nمثال: 彼女を説得するのは一仕事だ。\n→ It is a labor to persuade her. / [difficult task ; hard work]",
 "一代": "جِيل, نَسْل (A single step or stage in the succession of natural descent; a rank or degree in) / جِيل (The average amount of time needed for children to grow up and have children of t)  [generation]\nمثال: その仕事は一代では成し遂げられないだろう。\n→ It seems the task will not be accomplished in our generation.",
