 "一件": "مَادَّة (Material; substance.) / أَمْر (An affair, condition, or subject, especially one of concern or (especially when ) / قَضِيَّة, أَمْر ((The) inducing cause or reason, especially of anything disagreeable or distressi) / مَادَّة, جِسْم (Pus.) / هَمَّ (To be important.)  [(one) matter]\nمثال: 彼はその一件を調査し始めた。\n→ He began to look into the matter.",
