 "一休み": "رَاحَة, اِسْتِرَاحَة (Relief from work or activity by sleeping; sleep.) / اِسْتَرَاحَ (To be based on; to rely on something for proof or explanation) / بَاقِيَّة (remainder) / أَثَارَة (remainder)  [(short) rest]\nمثال: 日陰で一休みしよう。\n→ Let's take a rest in the shade.",
 "一佐": "عَقِيد, زَعِيم (A commissioned officer in an armed military organization, typically the highest )  [colonel (JASDF, JGSDF)]",
 "一体": "جَهَنَّم, جَحِيم (A place of torment where some or all sinners are believed to go after death and ) / جَحِيم, جَهَنَّم (A place or situation of great suffering in life.) / جَحِيم (An extremely hot place.)  [(where) the hell]\nbefore an interrogative; forms an emphatic question\nمثال: 一体どこで彼に会ったんだ。\n→ Where on earth did you meet him? / [one object ; one body]\nمثال: ストライキとは従業員の集団が一体となって就労を拒否することです。\n→ A strike is a mass refusal to work by a body of employees. / [one form ; one style] / [one Buddhist image ; one carving]",
