 "一倍": "[multiplying by one ; original amount]\nمثال: この橋はあの橋の一倍半の長さがある。\n→ This bridge is one and half times as long as that. / أَكْثَر (comparative degree of many: in greater number. (Used for a discrete quantity.)) / أَكْثَر (comparative degree of much: in greater quantity, amount, or proportion. (Used fo) / أَكْثَر (comparative of much)  [(even) more] / ثُنَائِيّ (Made up of two matching or complementary elements.) / ضِعْف (Of twice the quantity.)  [double]",
