 "一向": "تَمَامًا (In a complete manner; thoroughly.)  [completely] / أبداً (Indicating degree, quantity or frequency greater than zero: to the slightest deg)  [(not) at all]\nin a negative sentence / [earnestly ; intently] / [Jōdo Shinshū]",
