 "一摘み": "قَرَصَ (To squeeze a small amount of a person's skin and flesh, making it hurt.) / قَرْصَة (The action of squeezing a small amount of a person's skin and flesh, making it h)  [pinch (of something)] / [easy victory]",
 "一撃": "[one blow ; one hit]\nمثال: 私は彼の耳に一撃を与えた。\n→ I dealt him a blow on the ear. / البَرْق (Any of various DC Comics superheroes who have the power of superspeed, derived f)  [flashing]",
 "一撫で": "سكتة دِمَاغِيَّة (A sudden interruption of blood supply to the brain, causing minor to major brain) / لَاطَفَ (to move one’s hand or an object along (a surface) in one dir) / مَلَّسَ (to move one’s hand or an object along (a surface) in one dir)  [(one) stroke]",
