 "一新紀元": "العَصْر الجَدِيد (A modern spiritual and religious movement.)  [new age]",
 "一方": "وَاحِد, وَاحِدَة (The number represented by the Arabic numeral 1; the numerical value equal to tha) / اَلْمَرْء (Any person (applying to people in general).)  [one (esp. of two)]\nمثال: 床は緑色に塗られていたが、一方壁は黄色だった。\n→ The floor was painted green, while the walls were yellow. / من ناحية أخرى, من جهة أخرى (From another point of view.)  [on the other hand]\nمثال: しかし、その一方、ラテン語はそのときまでに「死語」となっていた。\n→ But, then again, Latin was already a \"dead language\" by that time. / عِنْدَمَا (In contrast; whilst on the contrary; although.)  [whereas] / [just keeps ; being inclined to ...]\nafter noun, adjective-stem or plain verb\nمثال: 本屋で英語関係の本を見つけると、次々に買ってしまって、読まずにいるので、たまる一方です。\n→ I always buy the English-language books I come across at bookstores. But since I never read them, all they do is pile up.",
