 "不潔": "قَذِر, وَسِخ (Unclean; covered with or containing unpleasant substances such as dirt or grime.) / وَسَّخَ (To make (something) dirty.)  [dirty]\nمثال: レストランの不潔な皿に私達は吐き気を催させられた。\n→ The dirty plates in the restaurant disgusted us. / قَذِر, وَسِخ (Unclean; covered with or containing unpleasant substances such as dirt or grime.) / وَسَّخَ (To make (something) dirty.)  [dirty (story, money, etc.)]",
