 "世間の皆様": "عَلَنِيّ, عَامّ (Pertaining to the people as a whole, as opposed to a group of people; concerning) / عُمُومِيّ (Officially representing the community; carried out or funded by the government o) / عَامَّة, جُمْهُور (Chiefly preceded by the: members of the community or the people in general, rega)  [the public]",
