 "丘陵": "تَلّ, أَكَمَة (An elevated landmass smaller than a mountain.)  [hill]\nمثال: 飛行機から見ると、小さな丘陵は平地のように見える。\n→ Small hills look flat from an airplane. / سَفْح (A hill at the base of a mountain or mountain range.)  [foothills]",
